  "prefLabel": "Tax 102.01 Abatement application",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 102.01 “Abatement application” means the written request filed by a taxpayer with the municipality, pursuant to RSA 76:16 or RSA 79-A:10, seeking a tax abatement.\n\nSource. #2256, eff 1-2-83; ss by #2943, eff 12-31-84; amd by #4589, eff 3-24-89; ss by #5638, eff 9-1-93; ss by #7068, INTERIM, eff 8-15-99, EXPIRES, 12-13-99; ss and moved by #7152, eff 12-10-99 (from Tax 101.01); ss by #8985, eff 9-24-07; ss by #10623, eff 6-26-14; ss by 13686, eff 7-19-23",
